l run).\n- **Deliverable per build:** resolve from **explicit signals only**, **session-scoped**; backfill existing builds; honest \"no deliverable pinned yet\" when none â€” never fabricated.\n- **Grass = B+C hybrid workbench** (approved mockup): filter tabs (All/raw/refined/promoted + search) over a two-pane list+workbench; stable `grass-<hash>` ids; rawâ†’refinedâ†’promoted status; versioned `grass-<id>/dev-N` refinements that are pullable; promoted ideas link to the run; project-scoped.\n- **Verification standard (non-negotiable):** every UI wave's \"done\" = rendered-DOM assertions (positive + negative) **+** real Playwright/Chromium interaction test **+** orchestrator screenshot vs mockup **+** user sign-off; a string-grep gate is an automatic HALT (the v4 lesson). Playwright is dev-only (`pytest.importorskip`).\n\n## Risks tracked\n- R1 leaked PTYs (close keeps record; reconciler re-statuses; kill is the reap), R2 continue-divergence (new worktree, original intact), R3 summary fabrication (generate-twice + grounding filter), R4 deliverable mis-ID (explicit signals; \"unresolvedâ€”pin one\" when ambiguous), R5 vacuous UI gate (mitigated by the mandatory Playwright+screenshot+sign-off).\n\n## Build outcome (Execution Log)\n- **All 6 waves GREEN â€” 716 passed, 1 skipped; distro scan clean** (119 files, only the pywinpty exception). Commits: W1 `dd08c6b` Â· W2 `6b781aa` Â· W3 `3bcac71` Â· W4 `550c580` Â· W5 `bf8b438` Â· W6 `862e249`.\n- **Adversarial review caught real bugs the gates initially missed** â€” concrete evidence the verification standard worked:\n  - **W1:** hard-killed session reappeared in the live bar via `repopulate()` ~400ms later; Playwright raced past it â†’ fixed by excluding terminal-status sessions and extending the assertion to 900ms.\n  - **W4:** project-scoped doc-role signal made **every build panel claim the same artifact** (R4 fabrication), with a bug-encoding test giving false green â†’ rewritten session-scoped + multi-build regressi